This character pack contains a modified chibi-maid raster derivative. Changes
include AI-assisted derivation, community-Q visual adaptation, background
removal, downscaling, runtime packaging, and whole-character animation.

The character raster and adaptations are licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 and
are not covered by the repository MIT license. Plugin code, WhaleRig code,
shaders, UI, and motion implementation remain licensed under the repository
MIT license.
